OL,3,GNEWSA'A lot of pressure' - SSE
OL,4,AAirtricity to increase gas prices by
OL,5,A19%
OL,6,
OL,7,FNorthern Ireland's largest provider of
OL,8,Fnatural gas, SSE Airtricity, is to
OL,9,Fincrease its prices by almost 19% from
OL,10,F1 October for its 200,000 domestic and
OL,11,Fsmall business customers.
OL,13,FIt means the annual gas bill of a
OL,14,Ftypical household in the greater
OL,15,FBelfast and west gas network areas will
OL,16,Fincrease by almost #172.
OL,18,FThe company said "unprecedented levels
OL,19,Fof volatility in global energy markets
OL,20,Fand higher wholesale gas prices" had
OL,21,Fled to the price rise.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
